Licence for the contents of data/

The MIT License in the repository root covers the OnceOnly source code only.
It does NOT apply to this directory.

Everything under data/ keeps the terms of its source: Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

- data/reference/: real registry records (a subset of the source dataset).
- data/demo/: fictional claim documents that quote real registry serial
  ranges from the same dataset.
- data/raw/ (not committed): the downloaded source workbook.

Source and required attribution:
  Quartson, P., Haya, B.K., Bernard, T., Abayo, A., Rong, X., So, I.S., Elias, M. (2026).
  Voluntary Registry Offsets Database v2026-08, Berkeley Carbon Trading Project,
  UC Berkeley. https://gspp.berkeley.edu/berkeley-carbon-trading-project/offsets-database
  Registry data (c) the respective registries (Verra, Gold Standard).

Changes made by OnceOnly: rows were selected to cover the demo scenarios and
reformatted (parsed into registry, batch and unit ranges). The claimant
companies and documents in data/demo/ are fictional and labelled SYNTHETIC.
No endorsement by the Berkeley Carbon Trading Project or the registries is
implied.
